{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Weapons|H$irdsman's Sword}}

The Hirdsman's Sword is one of the best weapons of the game, often wielded by powerful factions and some minor factions as well. It has {{#show:{{PAGENAME}}|?basedmg}} base damage.

==How to Acquire==

First you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]].

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}Steel + _{q}Wood}{2} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Strength *Smithing}</math>

* Damage scales with strength and weapon quality using the following formula: <math>Damage = 115*\sqrt{\sqrt{Strength*{q}Sword}/10}</math>.

